+==== Handler support
+
+The extension is expected to be used in conjunction with the <<smnip>> extensions.
+In this case, the handlers introduced in Sections <<smnip-handler-vectored-external>> and <<smnip-fast-handler>> are applicable.
+
+For the SW dispatcher, an additional configuration assumption is
+that interrupts trapping to the SW dispatcher have the LSB of their interrupt vector table entry zero.
+
+If the interrupt vector table associated with a fast interrupt has its LSB set to one,
+the handler does not have to clear the pending bit at the hart level.
+It may nevertheless need to clear the pending bit at the peripheral, typically in case of a level-sensitive interrupt.
